667B OBS scripts (Node Playwright library, not the MCP). Node 20 (nvm); Playwright resolves from the worktree's frontend/node_modules or the sibling main checkout's. lib.cjs re-uses ../../../661B/walk/scripts/common.cjs (login, theme, sidebar cookie, console watch, sheet()).
  00-seed.cjs     RUN ONCE (done for before; idempotent — a re-run only appends an all-"already" entry to seed.json runs[]). REST as Alice: imports one open bank statement, creates + calculates 22 DRAFT reconciliations (period ends 5..26 Nov 2026), posts one backdated deposit (28 Oct, after the October list was locked). Writes ../seed.json (ids read by 01/02).
  01-capture.cjs  read-only capture: 11 targets × alice/carol × 1024/1440 × light/dark (60 page loads) + interactions (Alice 1440 light, Alice 1024 dark, Carol 1440 light). Opens and CANCELS the Discard dialog and the basis-filter select; changes the basis filter (URL only); runs the Investment Register report (a read). Never discards, completes or creates anything. Raw → /tmp/667B-$PHASE-raw/.
  02-assemble.cjs JSON (measurements / sel-compat / console / discover) + 13 contact sheets + 5 crops → ../../$PHASE/.
  probe.cjs       the in-page probe (structure-agnostic: reads raw tables and DataTable alike).
OBS-after (same data, frontend rebuilt from the slice head; do NOT re-seed), from this directory, unedited:
  PHASE=after node 01-capture.cjs && PHASE=after STACK="<frontend image + SHA>" node 02-assemble.cjs
